    "Rebuttal validation uses synthetic author-response scenarios and in-context rehearsal. Live reviewer, Overleaf and venue posting paths were outside the local test scope.",
    "The three scenario runs and regression tests exercise the mechanical gates and workflow artifacts. The upstream manual checklist includes additional interactive cases.",
